# Line endings
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository's tracked source is stored with CRLF endings, and
# `biome.json` (formatter.lineEnding = "crlf") is configured to match so that
# `bun run format` / `bun run lint` and the CI check pass on every platform.
# No repo-wide renormalization to LF is applied here on purpose: that is a
# deliberate, separate cleanup that should land in its own commit.

# Binary assets — never run text or line-ending filters over these.
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.wasm  binary
*.node  binary
*.gguf  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary

# Generated lockfile — keep it out of diffs and language stats.
bun.lock  -diff linguist-generated
